  "topics": [
    {
      "id": "condition_flow",
      "name": "击倒、休整与后续来敌",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "卡德霍首次被击倒时，文献记载会回复全部生命，随后进入休整：此时无法攻击、无法被阻挡，并获得无敌与孤立。孤立的原文提示指不能被同阵营选中。",
          "source_refs": [
            {
              "file": "complete-document-cards-with-tooltips.json",
              "actor": "卡德霍，黑流之源",
              "card_index": 4,
              "location": {
                "line": 539,
                "column": 371,
                "character_offset": 70302,
                "byte_offset_utf8": 79693
              },
              "revision": "436092",
              "url": "https://m.prts.wiki/w/%E5%8D%A1%E5%BE%B7%E9%9C%8D%EF%BC%8C%E9%BB%91%E6%B5%81%E4%B9%8B%E6%BA%90"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "波次说明保留了“从当前波次释放2次（存疑）”，另记5秒后的再次释放。这是文献自己标记的存疑，不据此确认本局波次数、出怪次数或开战后的时间。",
          "source_refs": [
            {
              "file": "complete-document-cards-with-tooltips.json",
              "actor": "卡德霍，黑流之源",
              "card_index": 4,
              "location": {
                "line": 539,
                "column": 371,
                "character_offset": 70302,
                "byte_offset_utf8": 79693
              },
              "revision": "436092",
              "url": "https://m.prts.wiki/w/%E5%8D%A1%E5%BE%B7%E9%9C%8D%EF%BC%8C%E9%BB%91%E6%B5%81%E4%B9%8B%E6%BA%90"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "摘要把后续敌人概括为“召唤”；完整说明明确猎犬proto和痛楚化身由关卡配置生成，而非卡德霍直接召唤。普通版原配置确有这些独立出怪条目，不证明本局已触发或已经清场。",
          "source_refs": [
            {
              "file": "complete-document-cards-with-tooltips.json",
              "actor": "卡德霍，黑流之源",
              "card_index": 3,
              "location": {
                "line": 528,
                "column": 0,
                "character_offset": 69129,
                "byte_offset_utf8": 78394
              },
              "revision": "436092",
              "url": "https://m.prts.wiki/w/%E5%8D%A1%E5%BE%B7%E9%9C%8D%EF%BC%8C%E9%BB%91%E6%B5%81%E4%B9%8B%E6%BA%90"
            },
            {
              "file": "complete-document-cards-with-tooltips.json",
              "actor": "卡德霍，黑流之源",
              "card_index": 4,
              "location": {
                "line": 539,
                "column": 371,
                "character_offset": 70302,
                "byte_offset_utf8": 79693
              },
              "revision": "436092",
              "url": "https://m.prts.wiki/w/%E5%8D%A1%E5%BE%B7%E9%9C%8D%EF%BC%8C%E9%BB%91%E6%B5%81%E4%B9%8B%E6%BA%90"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "文献记载关卡到特定波次时会强制使卡德霍发动【感受痛楚】，技能结束后退场。此处未还原本局波次推进、触发时刻或通关结算。",
          "source_refs": [
            {
              "file": "complete-document-cards-with-tooltips.json",
              "actor": "卡德霍，黑流之源",
              "card_index": 3,
              "location": {
                "line": 528,
                "column": 0,
                "character_offset": 69129,
                "byte_offset_utf8": 78394
              },
              "revision": "436092",
              "url": "https://m.prts.wiki/w/%E5%8D%A1%E5%BE%B7%E9%9C%8D%EF%BC%8C%E9%BB%91%E6%B5%81%E4%B9%8B%E6%BA%90"
            },
            {
              "file": "complete-document-cards-with-tooltips.json",
              "actor": "卡德霍，黑流之源",
              "card_index": 4,
              "location": {
                "line": 539,
                "column": 371,
                "character_offset": 70302,
                "byte_offset_utf8": 79693
              },
              "revision": "436092",
              "url": "https://m.prts.wiki/w/%E5%8D%A1%E5%BE%B7%E9%9C%8D%EF%BC%8C%E9%BB%91%E6%B5%81%E4%B9%8B%E6%BA%90"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cadejo",
      "name": "卡德霍的分担伤害与位移",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "普通攻击优先选择阻挡数最高的我方单位；完整文献说明，这一选择不受它是否正被该单位阻挡影响。",
          "source_refs": [
            {
              "file": "complete-document-cards-with-tooltips.json",
              "actor": "卡德霍，黑流之源",
              "card_index": 4,
              "location": {
                "line": 539,
                "column": 371,
                "character_offset": 70302,
                "byte_offset_utf8": 79693
              },
              "revision": "436092",
              "url": "https://m.prts.wiki/w/%E5%8D%A1%E5%BE%B7%E9%9C%8D%EF%BC%8C%E9%BB%91%E6%B5%81%E4%B9%8B%E6%BA%90"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "【痛吼】有两条分支：攻击范围内有我方单位时，由范围内目标分担文献所列总物理伤害；范围内没有我方单位时，改为全场另一档物理伤害和晕眩。两种结果不能相加。",
          "source_refs": [
            {
              "file": "complete-document-cards-with-tooltips.json",
              "actor": "卡德霍，黑流之源",
              "card_index": 0,
              "location": {
                "line": 501,
                "column": 0,
                "character_offset": 66681,
                "byte_offset_utf8": 75405
              },
              "revision": "436092",
              "url": "https://m.prts.wiki/w/%E5%8D%A1%E5%BE%B7%E9%9C%8D%EF%BC%8C%E9%BB%91%E6%B5%81%E4%B9%8B%E6%BA%90"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "【行于荒原】先留下临时弹道，再闪现到下一检查点，弹道随后飞向它的位置，对沿途碰到的我方单位造成法术伤害并降低攻击速度。同名减益不叠加；本局路线和命中未验证。",
          "source_refs": [
            {
              "file": "complete-document-cards-with-tooltips.json",
              "actor": "卡德霍，黑流之源",
              "card_index": 1,
              "location": {
                "line": 510,
                "column": 0,
                "character_offset": 67754,
                "byte_offset_utf8": 76691
              },
              "revision": "436092",
              "url": "https://m.prts.wiki/w/%E5%8D%A1%E5%BE%B7%E9%9C%8D%EF%BC%8C%E9%BB%91%E6%B5%81%E4%B9%8B%E6%BA%90"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "降攻速的持续时间有资料差异：同页摘要写20秒，完整基础技能卡与普通版原配置写10秒。两种记载都保留，不能据此确认当前对局实际持续时间。",
          "source_refs": [
            {
              "file": "complete-document-cards-with-tooltips.json",
              "actor": "卡德霍，黑流之源",
              "card_index": 1,
              "location": {
                "line": 510,
                "column": 0,
                "character_offset": 67754,
                "byte_offset_utf8": 76691
              },
              "revision": "436092",
              "url": "https://m.prts.wiki/w/%E5%8D%A1%E5%BE%B7%E9%9C%8D%EF%BC%8C%E9%BB%91%E6%B5%81%E4%B9%8B%E6%BA%90"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "【湮灭】文献写扣除30点关卡生命并强制击杀自身；不是本局已发生的记录，也不能只凭该数字断定所有对局必然失败。",
          "source_refs": [
            {
              "file": "complete-document-cards-with-tooltips.json",
              "actor": "卡德霍，黑流之源",
              "card_index": 2,
              "location": {
                "line": 519,
                "column": 0,
                "character_offset": 68493,
                "byte_offset_utf8": 77684
              },
              "revision": "436092",
              "url": "https://m.prts.wiki/w/%E5%8D%A1%E5%BE%B7%E9%9C%8D%EF%BC%8C%E9%BB%91%E6%B5%81%E4%B9%8B%E6%BA%90"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "avatars",
      "name": "痛楚化身离场后的变化",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "痛楚化身文献写出场时获得3秒无敌，普通攻击同样优先阻挡数最高的我方单位。【痛吼】仍分范围内分担和范围内无人时的全场攻击；后者晕眩记为5秒，不套卡德霍的8秒。",
          "source_refs": [
            {
              "file": "complete-document-cards-with-tooltips.json",
              "actor": "痛楚化身",
              "card_index": 0,
              "location": {
                "line": 504,
                "column": 0,
                "character_offset": 67681,
                "byte_offset_utf8": 76724
              },
              "revision": "441718",
              "url": "https://m.prts.wiki/w/%E7%97%9B%E6%A5%9A%E5%8C%96%E8%BA%AB"
            },
            {
              "file": "complete-document-cards-with-tooltips.json",
              "actor": "痛楚化身",
              "card_index": 3,
              "location": {
                "line": 533,
                "column": 371,
                "character_offset": 72527,
                "byte_offset_utf8": 82961
              },
              "revision": "441718",
              "url": "https://m.prts.wiki/w/%E7%97%9B%E6%A5%9A%E5%8C%96%E8%BA%AB"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "图鉴原文只写剩余痛楚化身攻击提升；社区修正版及完整能力卡改为当前全场所有敌方单位获得攻击增益。两种记载并列保留，这不是已核对当前服务器的结论。",
          "source_refs": [
            {
              "file": "complete-document-cards-with-tooltips.json",
              "actor": "痛楚化身",
              "card_index": 3,
              "location": {
                "line": 533,
                "column": 371,
                "character_offset": 72527,
                "byte_offset_utf8": 82961
              },
              "revision": "441718",
              "url": "https://m.prts.wiki/w/%E7%97%9B%E6%A5%9A%E5%8C%96%E8%BA%AB"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "完整能力以痛楚化身“退场”为条件：全场敌方单位获得一层攻击增益（最多2层，叠加时以第一层数值为基础翻倍），按地图预设路径产生一批敌人，并使所有痛楚化身强制发动【行于荒原】。不能擅自把退场只改写为普通击杀，或把最多层数当当前面板。",
          "source_refs": [
            {
              "file": "complete-document-cards-with-tooltips.json",
              "actor": "痛楚化身",
              "card_index": 3,
              "location": {
                "line": 533,
                "column": 371,
                "character_offset": 72527,
                "byte_offset_utf8": 82961
              },
              "revision": "441718",
              "url": "https://m.prts.wiki/w/%E7%97%9B%E6%A5%9A%E5%8C%96%E8%BA%AB"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "痛楚化身的【行于荒原】在技能结束时闪现并发出弹道；技能期间持有无敌、晕眩和冻结免疫，并提高按生命上限计的回复速度。它与卡德霍的位移卡不同，不共用实际时钟。完整原值与全部限定分别保留。",
          "source_refs": [
            {
              "file": "complete-document-cards-with-tooltips.json",
              "actor": "痛楚化身",
              "card_index": 1,
              "location": {
                "line": 513,
                "column": 0,
                "character_offset": 68744,
                "byte_offset_utf8": 77992
              },
              "revision": "441718",
              "url": "https://m.prts.wiki/w/%E7%97%9B%E6%A5%9A%E5%8C%96%E8%BA%AB"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "痛楚化身的【湮灭】文献写每个扣除10点关卡生命并强制击杀自身；不由原始冷却字段生成当前倒计时，也不自动补造其它退场效果。",
          "source_refs": [
            {
              "file": "complete-document-cards-with-tooltips.json",
              "actor": "痛楚化身",
              "card_index": 2,
              "location": {
                "line": 522,
                "column": 0,
                "character_offset": 71443,
                "byte_offset_utf8": 81793
              },
              "revision": "441718",
              "url": "https://m.prts.wiki/w/%E7%97%9B%E6%A5%9A%E5%8C%96%E8%BA%AB"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "hound",
      "name": "猎犬proto的锁定撕咬",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "猎犬proto只进行阻挡攻击，普通攻击附加狂躁损伤。它不是卡德霍的新形态，不与痛楚化身的原图或技能合并。",
          "source_refs": [
            {
              "file": "complete-document-cards-with-tooltips.json",
              "actor": "猎犬proto",
              "card_index": 1,
              "location": {
                "line": 506,
                "column": 371,
                "character_offset": 75710,
                "byte_offset_utf8": 86139
              },
              "revision": "436178",
              "url": "https://m.prts.wiki/w/%E7%8C%8E%E7%8A%ACproto"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "【持续撕咬】的文献条件是范围内存在非飞行我方单位；发动后传送到目标所在地块中心并锁定持续攻击，结束后返回技能开始时自身所在地块中心。不能把“非飞行”自行改成“只可攻击地面部署位”。",
          "source_refs": [
            {
              "file": "complete-document-cards-with-tooltips.json",
              "actor": "猎犬proto",
              "card_index": 0,
              "location": {
                "line": 495,
                "column": 0,
                "character_offset": 69265,
                "byte_offset_utf8": 77370
              },
              "revision": "436178",
              "url": "https://m.prts.wiki/w/%E7%8C%8E%E7%8A%ACproto"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "该卡记载10秒持续攻击：每秒造成攻击力100%的法术普通伤害，附加30%攻击力的狂躁损伤，并施加1.5秒命中率减益，使物理及法术命中率最终降至20%（不叠加）。这些是固定文献参数，不是本局伤害或命中预测。",
          "source_refs": [
            {
              "file": "complete-document-cards-with-tooltips.json",
              "actor": "猎犬proto",
              "card_index": 0,
              "location": {
                "line": 495,
                "column": 0,
                "character_offset": 69265,
                "byte_offset_utf8": 77370
              },
              "revision": "436178",
              "url": "https://m.prts.wiki/w/%E7%8C%8E%E7%8A%ACproto"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "原文特意说明持续攻击不会随技能一起被打断，另列技能期间的多项免疫。不能简化成所有攻击永远不可打断，也不能用技能结束或打断时间代替实际持续攻击回调。",
          "source_refs": [
            {
              "file": "complete-document-cards-with-tooltips.json",
              "actor": "猎犬proto",
              "card_index": 0,
              "location": {
                "line": 495,
                "column": 0,
                "character_offset": 69265,
                "byte_offset_utf8": 77370
              },
              "revision": "436178",
              "url": "https://m.prts.wiki/w/%E7%8C%8E%E7%8A%ACproto"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
